{
  "version": "1.0",
  "modelName": "Whatcom County Homelessness — Tiny Home Villages CLD",
  "modelNote": "Causal loop diagram converted from a wxSVG export of a hand-drawn homelessness model (Bellingham / Whatcom County, WA). 34 variables, 51 causal links, 3 author comments. Source convention recovered on conversion: SOLID blue arrows are same-direction links (+), DASHED blue arrows are opposite-direction links (-) — e.g. more Tiny Home Village effectiveness means fewer Sweeps, more Shelter Capacity means a smaller visible street population. Green-outlined variables were marked in the source as the leverage points; red-outlined variables are the problem outcomes the model is aimed at. Layout coordinates are the original drawing's, shifted into positive space. The model is about increasing the flow OUT of homelessness; it does not model the flow in — see the author's own comment node.",
